            <ArticleTitle>Interim report of Sino-Monica-Beijing for the years 1985-1989.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>125-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Interim results of Sino-Monica-Beijing for the 5 year period 1985-1989 are reported. The cardiovascular disease (CVD) risk factors increased between the surveys carried out in 1984-1985 and 1988-1989, especially blood cholesterol and body mass index.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
